ci(gate): let Renovate see the shared pipeline pin

Renovate github-actions manager resolves the current version from the
trailing comment on a pinned uses:. A bare SHA without one is a dependency it
cannot version, so it proposes nothing and the pin never moves, which makes
"Renovate bumps the pin" false for the one pin that gates merges here. Every
other pinned uses: in this organization already carries the shape.

0828ec8 is the commit ivan-pinatti-labs/gh-actions tagged v0.1.0.

